{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"better\":\"Y\",\"regress\":\"有，Y在S01、S06、S13等段的感受词仍然偏密，短时间扫读时不如X左右分栏来得直观。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"Y\",\"point\":\"Y\",\"why\":\"Y\",\"whole\":\"Y\",\"fine\":\"Y\"},\"why\":\"Y用加亮的关键词让每段心理转折更容易被迅速抓住，感受词按音乐进程出现，也更容易让观众把文字和正在听到的声音对应起来。它对人物内心矛盾的铺垫、反复和转变交代得更细，尤其是从怀念亲近、舍不得离开，到不再逼自己选边、带着想念继续生活，前后形成了更完整的心理过程。X的左右分栏更利落，但部分音乐变化、情绪层次和人物动机被压缩了，细腻程度不及Y。\"}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ecb1c22d-ab0b-4360-807b-5fbab6dcce0d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T210209110912Z", "elapsed_seconds": 81.281, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T21:03:30.401850+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "812fe4384294d5958f41761c60d6f3fb396c25fe58d79b7fe0e0f1f6b512638d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d